      "uid": "zhcn:7f28d24b68c5d423677d11c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正当我对他这些云里雾里的话\n感到困惑时，他带着几分教训的意味，\n目不转睛地盯着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc0ec0d69ab78e2c79923c05228d8e53e22bcee5c59d36d2a11509d00d5244d6",
