    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d0219cd934ab9e3ee1ad0d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某队伍训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "d270a6958428d36fa366ff73953b45f0f625870e233a8e53edd1eafb6c495517",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        80,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/80/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4e6d75cfda4c0d2e12505c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不要看错了这份责任与荣誉，\n请将其牢牢地铭记在心底。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bdf9b5cc572f8c54d706e6aee1527cb481ce5c28ae287096d0d235c7af940ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        80,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/80/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0c7ea7c0c41081ff7b6371a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（我以为我是明白的，可是——）",
      "source_fingerprint": "739eb27427fb59fdfcc8ce7890fc03a2db9b9e1bd8709509baf2beeb53cc1cf5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        81,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/81/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1caea634c35a11643e13454c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛马娘与训练员之间是休戚与共的关系。\n训练员是为了实现赛马娘的梦想，\n而一心一意支持她们的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "954e6ca0e2e379a184ee7594d2dff93200f78e2fcc0c6d42b8554e82ff8963ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        81,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/81/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1055da77ef55c047c6900d88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……不，现在还是先做好该做的事吧）",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf55c4b332c83de5a0650e0835864fef266eba125a0d14aa47e2b8322f4c247",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        82,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/82/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18d9441ad10aee06b8266be2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回想起首席训练员的话，也许在我身上\n还有什么……在他看来我尚未\n完全理解透彻的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7521a33b1a43cbf7d6dd90bc1cca6f57a8a0522cb976333b6a97153446f110e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        82,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/82/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67c86957c77eafa1e5a41ac1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果让她感到了不安，\n那就是我的责任。更何况，\n她是那么地拼命，那么地努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c9c51a2281f9c85eae7f0c5973eea82121b516ee1b82eea19627013a25b4f8a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        83,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/83/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07b8a57b41700e8a11f0f207",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——如果无法回应她的那份心意，\n我算哪门子训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80453cb47cc224d61905a1721c374e2fa4323a8ffcf2d06e578bd2c903693b23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        84,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/84/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:150df4db45301e9aef62b1e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我重新振作精神，走向办公桌。\n为了实现制霸『天皇赏（春）』的梦想——\n下一次，下次我一定要让她绽放出最耀眼的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0d545de71728bf835f903a183512723dad1898bac39c77c0df3b2f665789d3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        85,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/85/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:454b4df0759e6511976c9582",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        86,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/86/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d699c26185d855e0727f2ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——原来如此。『日经赏』是\n『天皇赏（春）』的前哨战对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "187df913a0fd9c3a1959958ab0525ea9d7e2ba3475aabb906b668ce0dd545f3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        86,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/86/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d6c8bac78a3db4c9131b513",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第二天，为了瞄准『天皇赏（春）』，\n我向她提出了新的赛程安排。",
      "source_fingerprint": "971b731f8b2881728f8ae811a9afaed516b537b6536a356f059a2ac7af102e1f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        87,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/87/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf3d7856f497e2aff785db78",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "具体内容是，取消参加『京都纪念』\n改为参加『日经赏』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fde74f292b4b4fc6d5caec307bb25a7409dc7549eaa9be004741324e1c029ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        88,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/88/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e4a979b781e66b6e971af05",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa2a331d2dcf56680e516898a4ae11aa832d2097fa7fd231b7be2c736ff15a99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        89,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/89/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48a3816c9d5a1a11c3fd5ad1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯",
      "source_fingerprint": "821ea6fd74a74c12dfe83babf1c9f495bee9012e2301d5b7f3010fff99b8fd6f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
