    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0416ba84178fc1bfb262201e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        89,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/89/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b784c506ba374c6a0df8ebb5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是说，先在2500米的长距离赛事中取得成绩，\n然后再迎战春季——大概是这样的安排，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99e1e5c0f1c80157c2661e420a66e10f48054096503a7a46f9498ee12d3636c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        89,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/89/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:481b818a90ef8f791c154142",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "导游A",
      "source_fingerprint": "e75dcd9a52fec1deedd22a1c5cbae9039690ac57860666cf055fb04101f072a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:252f6666a72219a65dcb8a6e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再次欢迎大家，本次旅行是为了征服智利名山\n而专门为赛马娘设计的登山旅行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dc931f443a5e131dc2ea5fbeb8509aa100fb2a6761928d6aa645617ae75c4e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17fc75adfa6f282c0e36652c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "严酷的每一天就要开始了，你能坚持下去吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5e71b5f2844e3ffeaaa7605fdce47064b934270dfae7a05c0181205da149c24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        90,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/90/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0da5b53ff775ff368047437d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想让她在『日经赏』中积累长距离赛事的经验，\n然后以此为基石，向着『天皇赏（春）』\n稳步进发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d55484274f63eabba6ec1922341e5440b5dc3dae38afae6d1ffeac9f9aa01306",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
